y scattering AIR columns via stack_columns kernel\n2. **MerkleTreeGpu::new_with_hash()** → compresses rows via poseidon2_compressing_row_hashes (1 call)\n3. **Layer loop** → builds merkle tree via poseidon2_adjacent_compress_layer (log(height) calls, typically 10-15)\n\n**Cost Breakdown (252ms):**\n- **106ms (42%)**: Likely stack_columns_kernel overhead — 584 descriptors × 256 threads suggests fine-grained scatter ops\n- **~80ms**: Poseidon2 hashing (row + layer compression)\n- **~66ms**: Memory transfers (host↔device for tree proofs, D2H root)\n\n**Optimization Opportunities:**\n1. **Batch stack_columns**: Merge multiple descriptors into fewer, larger kernels rather than 1 block per descriptor\n2. **Fuse row hashing + tree compression**: Combine poseidon2_compressing_row_hashes and layer compression passes\n3. **Reduce descriptor count**: Group by height in StackedLayout to lower grid overhead\n\n**No per-AIR hash instances exist** — the 584 count is descriptor-granularity scattering, not per-AIR hash kernels. These *could* be batched by merging small scatter operations."}],"totalDurationMs":35826,"totalTokens":55558,"totalToolUseCount":22,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1619,"cache_read_input_tokens":53063,"output_tokens":871,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1619},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":5,"output_tokens":871,"cache_read_input_tokens":53063,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1619,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1619,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":8,"searchCount":9,"bashCount":5,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
