{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JtPK7tbC2dQDGw7UrWoYjf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Plan: Warp-per-trace MLE batch evaluation for small traces\n2\t\n3\t## Goal\n4\t\n5\tImprove MLE Rounds GPU utilization at APC 300 by introducing a warp-per-trace evaluation path for traces with small `num_y`. Currently, the batch MLE kernels (`zerocheck_batch_mle_kernel`, `logup_batch_mle_kernel`) assign one or more 128-thread blocks per trace regardless of `num_y`. Traces with `num_y` ≤ 32 waste ≥75% of threads. A dedicated warp-per-trace kernel packs 4 small traces per 128-thread block, directly producing per-trace sums via warp-level reduction and eliminating the secondary `batched_final_reduce_block_sums` kernel for the small-trace partition."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6086bd80-4e0d-45db-9a25-2370973b0822","uuid":"c9804040-dc0e-4a67-914e-5f3bf2c4d1b4","timestamp":"2026-04-14T21:11:42.600Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md","content":"# Plan: Warp-per-trace MLE batch evaluation for small traces\n\n## Goal\n\nImprove MLE Rounds GPU utilization at APC 300 by introducing a warp-per-trace evaluation path for traces with small `num_y`. Currently, the batch MLE kernels (`zerocheck_batch_mle_kernel`, `logup_batch_mle_kernel`) assign one or more 128-thread blocks per trace regardless of `num_y`. Traces with `num_y` ≤ 32 waste ≥75% of threads. A dedicated warp-per-trace kernel packs 4 small traces per 128-thread block, directly producing per-trace sums via warp-level reduction and eliminating the secondary `batched_final_reduce_block_sums` kernel for the small-trace partition.","numLines":5,"startLine":1,"totalLines":245}}}
